{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0233_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a70317138cc5663b0c9ebc75b83f5ae89da7fd06840c212a9be2391a092b91ba", "ja": "（あれ？　あそこにいるのは……美也か。\n何をしてるんだろう……？）", "zh": "（咦？在那里的是……美也吗？她在做什么呢……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0233_1001_p", "source_sha256": "443e0b9c3cc174d57d4e9a26f9f7b074d450e58835011c8ef09c3e41d76d4129", "ja": "美也、こんにちは。\nどうしたんだ？　こんな道端で。", "zh": "美也，你好。\n怎么了？怎么在这种路边？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0233_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "48d6bad8c0a72092cc8015fd5452fa230f3f8bd922dba49919965899ba254c2e", "ja": "おや～、{$P$}さん、こんにちは～。\n天気を予想できないか、試していたんです～。", "zh": "哎呀～，{$P$}先生，你好～  \n我在试着看看能不能预测天气～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0233_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "172cb21a8ea6b0245bcfff2689dddac58bae3d6a4d0806407f4b8fe8398ab132", "ja": "でも……難しいですな～。空を見ていても、\n明日の天気は、全然わかりません～。", "zh": "可是……真难啊～就算一直看着天空，也完全不知道明天会是什么天气～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0233_1004_p", "source_sha256": "84fe68bd9d32bd3bd98bfe95f876cb6e920fd2ade2583334ed3307a441d24253", "ja": "うーん。気象予報士も厳しい試験があるみたいだし、\n難しいんだろうな……でも、どうして急にそんな事を？", "zh": "嗯……听说气象预报员也要通过很严格的考试，应该很难吧……不过，为什么突然说起这个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0233_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "5a6686590d48117afcd56d057d9d7965f08f9d68ed2d59e37c540fcd35a22a14", "ja": "天気が予報できれば、お天気お姉さんのお仕事が\nいつ来ても、大丈夫ですからね～。", "zh": "只要能预报天气，无论什么时候来当气象播报员的工作，我都没问题啦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0233_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "4fcff61ff32e1ea359814f42c3e126ce3830d4559afc66c562ec0acfb9751a4a", "ja": "お散歩の途中で、カエルさんを見つけたんです～。\n声をかけたら、ケロケロって返事をしてくれて。", "zh": "散步途中，我发现了一只青蛙～  \n我跟它打了声招呼，它就“呱呱”地回应我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0233_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "7d0ccafebc549d29a55dc8920e4d88941ff4b6ff73bf9b7204d8ff7e043103ff", "ja": "それで「カエルが鳴くと雨が降る」って\n言葉を思い出したんです～。", "zh": "于是我想起了“青蛙一叫就会下雨”这句话～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0233_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "0d0721990493eb02b183d343174a00be5e5cb9a0713f4b28d13f2f5fe142639e", "ja": "「猫が顔を洗うと雨になる」とも言いますし、\n動物さん達はすごいですな～。", "zh": "也有“猫洗脸就会下雨”的说法，\n动物们可真厉害呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0233_1009_p", "source_sha256": "49167ec754d534fa4bf14727e196e1741e3f18501f44429bd64f6581f72d5b94", "ja": "そうだな……確か、動物が天気を当てるのは、\n湿度の変化が関係してるって聞いた事があるよ。", "zh": "是啊……我记得，听说动物能预测天气，和湿度的变化有关。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0233_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "e29fd1af0dad1b6d1cd4db91cb651b44580dc3a05391360bcb4cb1c059d3842d", "ja": "おお～、湿度ですか……。\nなるほどなるほど～……ふふふ～♪", "zh": "哦～是湿度啊……。\n原来如此，原来如此～……呵呵呵～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0233_1011_p", "source_sha256": "44368c18d7e88f4b64090cef2167de444e5bd896e7aef5e044272c34d169a533", "ja": "ん？　急に笑ってどうしたんだ？", "zh": "嗯？怎么突然笑起来了？发生什么事了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0233_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "dd09601e75192663bc760eb06ad7f262b71b4926ebcd8d8b1050075531c53145", "ja": "はい～。私、湿気が多いと、\nいつもより髪がうねうねってするんです～。", "zh": "是的～天气一潮湿，我的头发就会比平时更加卷曲～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0233_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "5910f9685418a35d39f548b6711a9c3614d6e8caad86d91c869926f001636aec", "ja": "そんな日は雨が降るんだって、わかるんですよ～。\n動物さんと一緒だな～と思いまして。", "zh": "这种日子就会下雨，我能察觉到哦～\n我觉得这和动物很像呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0233_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d4d12f4a5dc0be415d7e7f8403bd1c4cfe3a88e7539f43d3203b4bd21f0c70bb", "ja": "はは、髪で天気がわかるのか。\n確かに、それもひとつの天気予報かもな！", "zh": "哈哈，光看头发就能知道天气啊。\n确实，这也算是一种天气预报吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0233_1015_042miy", "source_sha256": "f285cf80542935bfa07ad441fab9458bfe2168ed83474de123d055f5336355cf", "ja": "そうかしれません～。\nいつも雨の日は、髪がワガママで困りましたけど……。", "zh": "也许是这样吧～。\n不过每逢下雨天，头发就很任性，真让人伤脑筋……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0233_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "6870ea8aa38019533c6055c19ecd2bc1041b84302779025b45f3e747c216eab7", "ja": "天気予報だと思えば、すごいことですね～。\n私、雨の日がもっと好きになりそうです～。ふふふ～♪", "zh": "要是当成天气预报来看的话，那可真厉害呢～。\n我感觉自己会变得更加喜欢雨天了～。呵呵呵～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
